<template><div class="page"><div class="site-container prose"><span class="eyebrow">Governance</span><h1>Transparent technical decisions.</h1><p>Changes begin with public issues or proposals. Maintainers evaluate accessibility, API consistency, bundle impact, browser behavior, and ecosystem compatibility before merging.</p><h2>Decision process</h2><ol><li>Open a problem-focused proposal.</li><li>Collect community and maintainer feedback.</li><li>Prototype and test the smallest durable API.</li><li>Document the decision and migration impact.</li><li>Release through changesets and public CI.</li></ol><h2>Conflict of interest</h2><p>Sponsors do not receive control over technical decisions, preferential security handling, or private premium components.</p></div></div></template>
